      "full_text": "1.01.010 Adoption.\n\nPursuant to the provisions of RCW 35.21.500 through 35.21.570, there is adopted the “Everett Municipal Code,” as compiled, edited and published by Book Publishing Company, Seattle, Washington. (Ord. 354-75 § 1, 1975.)",
